state cutoff(0.5)
state shape(Wave::Saw)
state depth(0.25)
state bright(true)

Synth lead:
    Osc as carrier /220 | wave=shape:
        Feeds: low
    Osc as lfo /2 | rate=0.5 wave=Sine:
        Modulates /depth: low
    Filter as low /(cutoff * 4000):
        Feeds: mix
        Feeds when bright: master
    Mixer as mix
    Output as speaker

Osc sub /55 | wave=Square:
    Feeds: lead.low

Output master
